==Requirements==
Player must own a usable glide-trainable [[ride]] along with waiting at least one day after completion of [[Quest:Glide Training: Basic Training]] in order to do [[Quest:Glide Training: Confidence Is Key]]
==To Start==
Speak with [[Troy Ridewrangler]] located near the [[Seaside]] [[Warpstones|Warpstone]].
==Goals==
Bounce through the fiery hoop above the launch pad in Snowhill while on your untrained glide-trainable ride.
*Bounce through the Snowhill hoop
*Return to Troy Ridewrangler
==Steps==
#Speak with [[Troy Ridewrangler]] located near the [[Seaside]] [[Warpstones|Warpstone]].
#*"The third step in training a ride is to instill a sense of confidence in your ride.<br />Go to the launch pads in Snowhill and jump through the fiery hoop above while riding your untrained glide-trainable ride." -Troy Ridewrangler
#Bounce through the Snowhill hoop
#*While on your ride bounce on the specific launch pad near the [[Snowhill]] [[Playground]], aim for the middle of the pad.
#Speak with [[Troy Ridewrangler]] located near the [[Seaside]] [[Warpstones|Warpstone]].
#*"Good job! Your ride's confidence has been magically transferred to the Training Saddle.<br />Training is hard work. Come back tomorrow and we can continue the training!" -Troy Ridewrangler
